---
---
<header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
        <h1>Austin Laubach</h1>
        <p class="role">Software engineering intern</p>
        <p class="lede">I write firmware, desktop tools and web apps, and I'm strongest in <strong>Linux, networking and embedded systems.</strong></p>
        <p class="meta">Baltimore, MD · B.S. Computer Science, UMBC, May 2027</p>
        <div class="cta">
            <a class="btn primary" href="/projects">View projects</a>
            <a href="/resume.pdf">Résumé (PDF)</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/cli-geek" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
<style>
    .hero .wrap {
        padding-block: 36px 32px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
    }
    h1 {
        font-size: var(--text-2xl);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.1;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        text-wrap: balance;
    }
    .role {
        font-size: var(--text-lg);
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-accent);
        margin-top: -6px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .lede {
        font-size: var(--text-md);
        color: var(--color-muted);
        max-width: 38em;
    }
    .lede strong {
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-weight: 500;
    }
    .meta {
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
        color: var(--color-muted);
    }
    .cta {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px 20px;
        margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .cta a:not(.btn) {
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
        font-weight: 500;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .hero .wrap {
            padding-block: 28px 24px;
        }
    }
</style>
